1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,140
Accept people as they are. Place them where they belong. You are responsible for your own life.

2
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,460
Acceptance frees you from trying to change anyone.

3
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:17,000
Boundaries protect your peace. Not everyone earns the same access, the same closeness,

4
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:22,880
or the same seat at your table. And that's not cruelty. That's self-respect.
